meta {
  name: Create Item (with API key)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/items
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "url": "https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
  }
}

docs {
  Proves the key from "3. Create API Key" actually authenticates, the same
  way the extension's background script does (`x-api-key` header, no Session
  cookie) — `enableSessionForAPIKeys` means this hits the exact same
  create-Item route as a cookie-authenticated request, no separate code path.
  Should return `201` with a Processing Item card.

  Try it with the header blank or an obviously wrong value too: should come
  back as a clear `401`, never a silent no-op (#143's requirement).
}
